	"data": "<!-- scanner: tagged active/ongoing but not updated in 78d — review -->\n\nRoom 2.0 — Linked Data Vocabulary (room2#)\n\nThe room2# namespace defines the RDF/JSON-LD vocabulary for Room 2.0's spatial knowledge graph. It extends the ThoughtBubbles tb# namespace — both share the same underlying architecture (ECS at runtime, JSON-LD at rest), but room2# adds spatial, device, and AR-specific predicates.\n\nNamespace\n\nReuses from tb#: @id, @type, LinkFrom, LinkTo, createdAt, lastUpdated, Thought,…",
